WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.290
Blackpool.

2
00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:06.430
Life expectancy at birth
for men here is 73.1 years.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.370
Wokingham.

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.310
For men here, the figure is 82.5 years.

5
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.310
Same country, same years.

6
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.210
A gap of about nine years of life.

7
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.750
So what could work have to
do with how long people live?

8
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.310
In this mission, you'll sort
jobs into four economic sectors,

9
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.370
and into types of employment,
from part-time to self-employed.

10
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.930
Then you'll compare the
two towns' work, pay,

11
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.690
health and education, and
test how the links run.

12
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.120
Your mission: explain what work has to do
with how long people live in each town.
